{'symbol': 'KMI', 'date': '2021-10-07 16:25:00', 'title': 'RILEY PERMIAN ANNOUNCES EOR PROJECT UPDATES AND DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'OKLAHOMA CITY, OCT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RILEY EXPLORATION PERMIAN, INC.\xa0(NYSE AMERICAN: REPX) ("RILEY PERMIAN", THE "COMPANY", "WE" OR "OUR") TODAY ANNOUNCED UPDATES RELATED TO ITS ENHANCED OIL RECOVERY (EOR) PILOT PROJECT AND ITS UPCOMING DIVIDEND. THE COMPANY EXECUTED TWO AGREEMENTS, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 7, 2021, RELATED TO ITS EOR PILOT PROJECT.'}